      {
        "type": "institutional-versus-statistical-regional-surface-model",
        "note": "INSEE records 17 institutional regions, including five overseas regions, while the France regional/statistical field used by the COG exposes 18 regional-level surfaces. DROPi governs the 18 current COG regional codes as navigation/economic attachment surfaces without claiming that all 18 have identical institutions."
